1d79222f96580e70ba2bbda2b0bf.mp4?t=1738660322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fuwa Fuwa Cafe\u2014a maid cafe tucked away in a quiet part of Nipponbashi, and where a wonderful encounter is about to take place...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You, the protagonist, quit your job at an extremely toxic workplace and find yourself at a run-down maid cafe, where a cute maid named Shiro works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At first, you only agree to become the new manager because it conveniently met all your urgent needs, but soon the colorful maids Miyu, Favna, and Honoka join in. And as you spend time with them and meet the people of Electric Street, both you and the cafe will gradually liven up once more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1789030/extras/e32b3a143bb50f6c612e722d287ca970.poster.avif?t=1738660322\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1789030/extras/e32b3a143bb50f6c612e722d287ca970.webm?t=1738660322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1789030/extras/e32b3a143bb50f6c612e722d287ca970.mp4?t=1738660322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> As the manager of Fuwa Fuwa, you\u2019ll live in Nipponbashi, Osaka and spend time with your favorite maid... or maids. Go shopping, watch a movie, go for karaoke, buy a present for a special someone... What you choose to do will affect the ending of the story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Of course, you want to always be doing what's best for the cafe. So maybe you should do something about the ominous voices coming from the shrine next to the cafe, or you could get the whole town involved in a large-scale campaign to bring in even more business. All sorts of events await you and the maids! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1789030/extras/fe5f928674bf8f05c3485e06d883fc2d.poster.avif?t=1738660322\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1789030/extras/fe5f928674bf8f05c3485e06d883fc2d.webm?t=1738660322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1789030/extras/fe5f928674bf8f05c3485e06d883fc2d.mp4?t=1738660322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your most important job as the manager is, of course, to manage the cafe and the maids. It's a little harder than it sounds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First, you\u2019ll have to allocate work to your maids. Shiro loves serving customers, and Miyu\u2019s a great chef... Make sure each girl is assigned the right job!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While the cafe is open, you can help out by serving customers and cheering the maids on with your special skill. And with your hard-earned money, you can go shopping, eat out, or buy merch or capsule toys for your otaku collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make Fuwa Fuwa the most popular cafe in town to enjoy Nipponbashi to the fullest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1789030/extras/b940875264c4684863eed0453030b6cc.poster.avif?t=1738660322\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1789030/extras/b940875264c4684863eed0453030b6cc.webm?t=1738660322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1789030/extras/b940875264c4684863eed0453030b6cc.mp4?t=1738660322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes, special customers will visit Fuwa Fuwa. Pay attention to their needs and serve them the perfect coffee! You can find coffee recipes hidden all around Electric Street, and the customers will drop hints as to what they're looking for in your conversations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the town, collect recipes, and serve the drinks of your customers\u2019 dreams, and maybe one day they might offer you their service as well...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1789030/extras/8c0befde3c26a5c622ac857330579021.poster.avif?t=1738660322\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1789030/extras/8c0befde3c26a5c622ac857330579021.webm?t=1738660322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1789030/extras/8c0befde3c26a5c622ac857330579021.mp4?t=1738660322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visit stores you can find in the real Nipponbashi, such as Surugaya, Sofmap, Dragon Star, Super Potato, and Karaoke Rainbow, among the many others we've collaborated with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can collect merchandise of other indie games too, such as VA-11 Hall-A: Cyberpunk Bartender Action, GNOSIA, and Marfusha!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go shopping, see the sights, and enjoy life in otaku heaven. But don't stay out too late; you still have a cafe to run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And though it's fun to go out on your own, you could always ask one of the maids to go out with you. Uh, not <i>go out</i> go out... unless?</p>",
